@startuml
title State diagram for Ott Based System Mini Reel class

[*] --> Idle

state "Idle" as Idle
state "Account Created" as AccountCreated
state "Video Uploaded" as VideoUploaded
state "Video Viewed" as VideoViewed
state "Likes List" as LikesList
state "Discussion Option" as DiscussionOption

Idle --> J1 : Create account
J1 --> AccountCreated : Successful registration
AccountCreated --> J2 : Upload video
J2 --> VideoUploaded : Video uploaded successfully
VideoUploaded --> J3 : View video
J3 --> VideoViewed : Video viewed successfully
VideoViewed --> J4 : Save to likes list
J4 --> LikesList : Video saved in likes list
LikesList --> J5 : View saved videos
J5 --> AccountCreated : Return to account created state

AccountCreated --> J6 : Enter discussion option
J6 --> DiscussionOption : Discussion option entered successfully

VideoViewed --> [*] : Exit system

DiscussionOption --> [*] : Exit system

@enduml
